# One-off scripts — data fixes, audits, targeted sends. These usually carry
# real names, phones and emails, and this repo is public, so they live in
# server/scripts/local/ and never get committed. Schema changes go in
# server/scripts/migrations/ (tracked); reusable admin tools in
# server/scripts/tools/ (tracked).
